<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia S.Steel year net up 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia S.Steel year net up 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 120.71   vs	  75.45</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 43.1    vs	  26.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,112.40   vs	 927.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   126.05   vs	  80.06</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  2.08   vs  less   2.81</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	   0.13</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     7.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Southern Steel Bhd manufactures and trades steel products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
